## Problems/Best-Practices - PBP

1. PBP-1

Problem: 
If an env files is used in a project, .env.example should be kept in sync with all environment variables the application reads, making it easier for a new developer to configure the application from scratch. 
If not in sync, the new developers will find it hard to configure the application from scratch.

Solution/Best practice:
.env.example should mirror all keys in .env (without secret values)